<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3849" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλᾰλητός</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλᾰλ-ᾱτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλαλαί</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shout of victory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.78
			</span></i>; <i>war-cry, battle-shout</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				686
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.72
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>loud shouting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.14
			</span></i>&lt;*&gt;; <i>halloo</i>, in hunting, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
			</span></i> Dam.<i><span class="en">
				p.6
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> rarely, <i>cry of woe</i>
			or <i>wailing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.10
			</span></i>; com., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δὲ πλακούντων.. ἦν
			ἀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Telecl.
				1.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> rarely of
			other sounds, <i>loud noise</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.51
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
